{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-03-18 07:03:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX TO EXPAND INTO CHILE AND PERU WITH US$705 MILLION ACQUISITION OF 4 ENTEL DATA CENTERS', 'text': "ENTRY INTO GROWING DATA CENTER AND CLOUD HUB TO ACCELERATE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION OPPORTUNITIES FOR LOCAL BUSINESSES AND MULTINATIONAL COMPANIES REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., MARCH 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PLANNED EXPANSION INTO CHILE AND PERU THROUGH ITS INTENDED ACQUISITION OF FOUR DATA CENTERS FROM EMPRESA NACIONAL DE TELECOMUNICACIONES S.A."}